{"completed": true, "response": "他和这个亲近的人已经有一段很珍贵的相处，所以每次靠近对方，他感受到的不只是开口前的犹豫，还有真实的温暖和安心。他想了很久、也早就知道该怎么说的那份心意，并没有因为这些温暖而消失，反而越是在乎对方，就越难把想说的话和眼前的关系分开。他既想让对方知道自己的心意，也明白，一旦说出口，两人的相处可能就会改变。所以，他一度更想把心意说出来，却始终没有真正坦白。他心里那份不舍，不是因为已经失去了什么，也不是觉得只要不说就够了，而是因为眼前这段关系本身就很珍贵，他不愿轻易改变它。这一段里，他没有做出新的决定，也没有找到两全的办法，只是既想表达自己的心意，又舍不得改变现在的关系。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2080a92-66f3-4bee-ba92-5a92d9ca231b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002918913217Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:29:26.473312+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3546a6aba9415c47d3d8ec511b2296609f8e5bcf910830336f5e5c80fc5907cd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt